   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider your own experiences with memory, such as remembering facts for a test versus recalling a personal event from years ago. How do you imagine these types of memories—semantic (facts) and episodic (events)—might change as people age? How might these changes affect day-to-day life in late adulthood?",
